      "value": "I am having similar issues where hovering over a Canvas Button does not trigger the highlighted event (for Animation, Color Tint and Sprite Swap transition types) in desktop mode, but does trigger as expected in VR and within the Unity Editor.\n\nNote that Alt-tabbing between VRChat in desktop mode and another window will trigger the hover event when the cursor is over the button.\n\nTo reproduce the issue:\nAdd a Canvas and Button to your scene with the regular VRChat UI workflow, and set the button's Highlighted Color to Red.\nTest in Unity Editor, VRChat in desktop mode and VRChat in VR mode and observe the difference in behavior.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
