  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have been working on an avatar configuration panel using VRC_UiShape, and have noticed that when the vrchat application has mouse control, the transition colours on components such as toggle and button do not correctly display.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/VUHg6Yre5AY (Youtube, 60seconds)\n\nThe video demonstrates what the colours should look like using the unity editor. I then proceed into vrchat in desktop mode with the same panel in game to show how releasing the mouse has the colours correct, but when vrchat has control the colours do not display properly.\n\nAs a note it happens the same way in vr. You need to minimise vrchat to get the feedback colours to show correctly on the panel in vr. I can make a video example of me reproducing this in vr if necessary.",
